WEBVTT

00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:03.680
Watch over me, like you always do.

00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:06.680
Okay, see you later!

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:10.190
Captain?

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:17.730
What's the enemy's location?

00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:21.200
Here's Pudder supply base #3,
where we are right now.

00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:25.080
They're around here,
about 20 kilometers away.

00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:27.370
Is the enemy's new model there, too?

00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:28.200
I don't know.

00:00:28.510 --> 00:00:31.580
From the number of trailers,
we can assume it is.

00:00:32.790 --> 00:00:36.100
They've already come well beyond the border.

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:38.300
Last time it was a small squad,

00:00:38.570 --> 00:00:40.330
but Seeker's reports say

00:00:40.330 --> 00:00:44.140
they've joined with a battalion
and swelled in size.

00:00:44.930 --> 00:00:47.010
This is a problem.

00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:49.520
What did Command say?

00:00:49.810 --> 00:00:52.390
Nothing, yet.

00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:54.160
What shall we do?

00:00:54.160 --> 00:00:56.410
Just wait for dawn?

00:00:56.410 --> 00:00:58.520
No, faster is better here.

00:00:58.520 --> 00:00:59.150
Then...

00:01:00.150 --> 00:01:01.870
Prepare to withdraw.

00:01:01.870 --> 00:01:03.800
We'll act as the rear guard.

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:40.970
Defeat

00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:44.960
It's cold.

00:02:46.560 --> 00:02:47.590
Yeah.

00:02:49.120 --> 00:02:51.200
But it gets really hot during the day.

00:02:52.240 --> 00:02:53.360
Yeah.

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:03.910
What?

00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:06.130
So stiff.

00:03:06.130 --> 00:03:07.680
You mean the reinforced materials?

00:03:07.680 --> 00:03:11.080
Idiot. I'm not talking about your helmet.

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:12.040
I'm sorry.

00:03:16.140 --> 00:03:19.170
So, what are you going to do?

00:03:19.850 --> 00:03:21.370
What do you mean?

00:03:21.370 --> 00:03:22.770
What else can I do?

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:25.300
I've decided.

00:03:27.380 --> 00:03:28.810
When it's time to do it, I will.

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:31.820
I see.

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:39.410
You know...

00:03:39.410 --> 00:03:40.070
Yes?

00:03:43.810 --> 00:03:44.740
No,

00:03:45.390 --> 00:03:46.330
forget it.

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:49.580
Hey, guys.

00:03:49.580 --> 00:03:51.350
Good evening.

00:03:51.350 --> 00:03:53.320
We've been ordered to withdraw.

00:03:53.320 --> 00:03:56.220
We'll take over your shift, so go get ready.

00:03:56.220 --> 00:03:57.150
Right.

00:03:57.150 --> 00:03:58.340
At last, huh?

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:06.100
Go on ahead.

00:04:07.190 --> 00:04:08.400
All right.

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:11.470
Yes?

00:04:11.470 --> 00:04:12.980
Hey, it's me.

00:04:13.340 --> 00:04:14.230
What is it?

00:04:16.120 --> 00:04:19.060
I heard you wanted to talk to Command,

00:04:19.060 --> 00:04:20.880
so I called you personally.

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:23.860
Seemed like it would be faster.

00:04:24.250 --> 00:04:26.520
So, you're withdrawing?

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:30.180
A company of reinforcements is heading your way.

00:04:30.180 --> 00:04:32.750
Shouldn't you wait a little longer?

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:35.130
The enemy's new model is nearby.

00:04:35.130 --> 00:04:36.930
Ah, I get it.

00:04:36.930 --> 00:04:39.290
So you have to fight back, then?

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:41.310
I see.

00:04:41.310 --> 00:04:44.490
That's right, you put a freeze
on Argevollen, didn't you?

00:04:44.490 --> 00:04:46.510
Sorry, I forgot.

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:50.260
Of course, I prioritize decisions
made on the field above all else.

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:52.850
The war belongs to the front lines.

00:04:53.440 --> 00:04:55.000
But you know, Samonji.

00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:56.990
I'll tell you just one thing.

00:04:58.460 --> 00:05:00.270
If you don't use Arge,

00:05:00.270 --> 00:05:01.770
a lot of people are going to die.

00:05:02.520 --> 00:05:04.780
And I don't mean as warriors who die fighting.

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:08.280
They'll die senseless deaths,
caught up in your stubbornness.

00:05:08.650 --> 00:05:12.050
Even I can't sit by and watch that happen.

00:05:12.640 --> 00:05:14.430
Not when you're going

00:05:14.430 --> 00:05:19.290
to let valuable soldiers die just
because you can't use one Krieger.

00:05:19.930 --> 00:05:22.450
We're fighting a war.

00:05:22.450 --> 00:05:25.130
And weapons are meant to be used.

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:26.480
Think about it.

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:29.300
Okay, that's that.

00:05:30.020 --> 00:05:33.560
Call Ingelmia and have them attack.

00:05:33.560 --> 00:05:35.560
Someone else will take care of that.

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:39.800
What did the Brigadier General say?

00:05:40.360 --> 00:05:41.690
It doesn't matter.

00:05:41.690 --> 00:05:43.820
We just have to prepare for the enemy.

00:05:47.610 --> 00:05:48.450
Yes?

00:05:51.520 --> 00:05:53.030
It's the mechanics.

00:05:53.030 --> 00:05:55.200
They're taking Argevollen to the trailer.

00:05:56.960 --> 00:06:00.130
Weren't we going to abandon
Argevollen since you froze it?

00:06:02.450 --> 00:06:03.690
Hurry and get ready.

00:06:04.490 --> 00:06:06.090
Roger.

00:06:10.820 --> 00:06:12.760
Hey, Tokimune!

00:06:16.330 --> 00:06:17.960
What's going on?

00:06:17.960 --> 00:06:19.900
They're loading Arge.

00:06:20.220 --> 00:06:22.720
There'd be trouble if we missed anything,

00:06:22.720 --> 00:06:24.860
so we wanted you to check it.

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:28.020
But it was frozen...

00:06:28.020 --> 00:06:31.930
As long as we're taking it,
we want it ready for the pilot.

00:06:31.930 --> 00:06:34.660
Just take a look at the
weapons and optional parts.

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:36.410
Right.

00:06:37.240 --> 00:06:38.660
I like the look on your face.

00:06:38.920 --> 00:06:39.690
Huh?

00:06:40.650 --> 00:06:41.970
Nothing.

00:06:41.970 --> 00:06:43.170
Get it over with.

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:44.290
Right!

00:06:51.520 --> 00:06:52.760
Incoming message from Seeker.

00:06:53.030 --> 00:06:55.680
The enemy force is heading this way.

00:06:56.520 --> 00:06:57.560
What about the new model?

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:04.190
It's not there.

00:07:05.150 --> 00:07:07.440
Begin withdrawing what vehicles you can.

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:08.670
Roger.

00:07:08.670 --> 00:07:11.720
Seeker will remain to observe
the enemy's rear forces.

00:07:11.720 --> 00:07:13.640
Is Argevollen loaded?

00:07:13.640 --> 00:07:15.330
It's all ready.

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:18.830
Send it out with the forces
that are withdrawing.

00:07:19.610 --> 00:07:20.760
Understood.

00:07:57.000 --> 00:07:59.450
Will he be okay?

00:07:59.730 --> 00:08:01.240
He'll be fine.

00:08:01.240 --> 00:08:04.120
He'll defeat Argevollen next time, for sure.

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:06.120
But something's not right.

00:08:06.120 --> 00:08:08.090
He should get checked out by a doctor.

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:12.320
That can wait until he's
defeated that Trail Krieger.

00:08:16.520 --> 00:08:19.050
Seirans 1 and 2 will split
up and engage the enemy.

00:08:19.720 --> 00:08:22.120
Our objective here is to
withdraw, and nothing more.

00:08:23.430 --> 00:08:27.090
Buy as much time as you can and
move to the rendezvous point.

00:08:27.090 --> 00:08:29.640
Seiran 3 will stay at the rear
of our withdrawing forces.

00:08:29.640 --> 00:08:30.320
Roger.

00:08:30.320 --> 00:08:31.150
Roger!

00:08:31.150 --> 00:08:32.210
Roger.

00:08:32.860 --> 00:08:35.240
What happened to the new model?

00:08:35.240 --> 00:08:37.830
It may have put too much stress on its pilot.

00:08:38.680 --> 00:08:43.480
It's entirely possible the enemy's new model is using the same system as Argevollen.

00:08:44.100 --> 00:08:45.420
But it will come.

00:08:52.350 --> 00:08:54.960
They won't slow you down, sir.

00:08:54.960 --> 00:08:57.470
Use the Gunbasses however you like.

00:08:57.470 --> 00:08:58.890
I don't need them.

00:08:58.890 --> 00:09:01.920
Use them to lure out Argevollen.

00:09:01.920 --> 00:09:04.370
Then you can do whatever you want.

00:09:05.710 --> 00:09:07.020
Roger.

00:09:07.020 --> 00:09:09.740
Richthofen, Sturm Alpha,

00:09:09.740 --> 00:09:10.770
heading out.

00:09:16.640 --> 00:09:19.200
Just wait, Argevollen.

00:09:50.920 --> 00:09:52.460
Loading complete!

00:09:52.460 --> 00:09:53.990
You don't need to hit them!

00:09:53.990 --> 00:09:55.570
Just drag them out in front of Silfy!

00:09:55.570 --> 00:09:57.320
I know that!

00:09:57.320 --> 00:09:58.200
Okay!

00:09:58.470 --> 00:09:59.920
Don't go crazy!

00:09:59.920 --> 00:10:01.810
Our attacks on them are only...

00:10:01.810 --> 00:10:03.270
...to buy time!

00:10:03.270 --> 00:10:04.660
I'm in a fight here!

00:10:04.660 --> 00:10:07.160
Lorenz-san is struggling...

00:10:13.970 --> 00:10:15.990
Tokimune, what are you doing?

00:10:15.990 --> 00:10:17.380
Right! Sorry!

00:10:18.360 --> 00:10:20.160
Lorenz, how are you doing?

00:10:20.160 --> 00:10:22.260
Hitting them as hard as I can.

00:10:24.140 --> 00:10:25.510
Damn it!

00:10:25.510 --> 00:10:27.640
Don't follow them too far, sexy boy.

00:10:27.640 --> 00:10:28.520
Right, right.

00:10:28.910 --> 00:10:30.650
New enemy model sighted.

00:10:30.910 --> 00:10:33.350
It's in a platoon formation, heading...

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:38.030
The new model is heading
for the withdrawing forces.

00:10:38.290 --> 00:10:41.780
Use the data from last time to
estimate the time of contact.

00:10:42.040 --> 00:10:43.160
Roger.

00:10:43.660 --> 00:10:45.550
The enemy's target is our entire force,

00:10:45.550 --> 00:10:47.900
including the withdrawing units!

00:10:53.010 --> 00:10:54.920
The new model is heading
for the withdrawing units?

00:10:59.520 --> 00:11:00.930
Seiran 2, how are you doing?

00:11:01.520 --> 00:11:03.480
Can you head for the runaways?

00:11:03.480 --> 00:11:04.930
No way!

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:08.720
The enemy's not letting me go.

00:11:08.720 --> 00:11:11.190
I'd love to go, but—

00:11:18.920 --> 00:11:21.450
I have to buy time, somehow...

00:11:33.210 --> 00:11:34.330
It's almost time.

00:11:34.970 --> 00:11:37.840
It's almost time, Argevollen.

00:11:39.350 --> 00:11:42.590
The new model and five other mechs will soon make contact with Seiran 3.

00:11:42.590 --> 00:11:43.790
Where's Silfy?

00:11:43.790 --> 00:11:45.830
Seiran 1 is still in combat with the enemy.

00:11:45.830 --> 00:11:47.600
It'll take a little longer
before I can get there!

00:11:47.880 --> 00:11:49.480
Same here!

00:11:51.720 --> 00:11:54.100
It's like they're telling us to send out Argevollen...

00:12:04.490 --> 00:12:07.080
Seiran 3, engaging the enemy.

00:12:33.890 --> 00:12:34.800
Okui-san...

00:12:43.170 --> 00:12:44.200
Go.

00:12:45.420 --> 00:12:46.120
Right!

00:12:46.380 --> 00:12:47.680
Use the Sekiei!

00:12:47.680 --> 00:12:48.520
Right!

00:12:49.900 --> 00:12:51.120
Pretty cool.

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:52.620
You idiot!

00:12:55.630 --> 00:12:56.720
What's wrong?

00:12:57.880 --> 00:12:59.400
This is Private Susumu!

00:13:02.570 --> 00:13:04.510
Return to your position, Private Susumu!

00:13:05.120 --> 00:13:06.510
Please let me go!

00:13:08.960 --> 00:13:10.090
Get back.

00:13:10.090 --> 00:13:11.740
Please let me go!

00:13:11.740 --> 00:13:14.020
You know very well, Captain...

00:13:14.020 --> 00:13:16.410
If I don't go out now, we'll be wiped out!

00:13:16.410 --> 00:13:18.720
Namie can't hold them off on her own.

00:13:18.720 --> 00:13:20.000
Everyone will die.

00:13:23.420 --> 00:13:27.030
I realize that if I go, I may die.

00:13:27.030 --> 00:13:29.780
I may end up an invalid.

00:13:30.130 --> 00:13:31.210
But

00:13:31.210 --> 00:13:33.490
just like how piloting Arge is dangerous,

00:13:33.490 --> 00:13:36.710
the whole unit is facing the
danger of dying in battle!

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:39.960
I don't want to regret this!

00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:41.740
This is an order. Go back.

00:13:41.740 --> 00:13:42.800
Captain!

00:13:43.060 --> 00:13:44.320
Go back!

00:13:44.320 --> 00:13:46.300
I won't lose control!

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:48.570
How can you guarantee that?

00:13:49.150 --> 00:13:50.560
So please, Captain...

00:13:51.260 --> 00:13:52.310
Please...

00:13:53.700 --> 00:13:55.780
Just you watch me!

00:14:03.520 --> 00:14:04.820
Captain Samonji!

00:14:17.570 --> 00:14:18.830
Captain Samonji!

00:14:20.520 --> 00:14:21.880
Watch over me!

00:14:23.650 --> 00:14:24.770
I'm going!

00:14:25.390 --> 00:14:28.840
I'm heading out to reinforce the withdrawing units!

00:14:34.900 --> 00:14:36.370
Are you sure?

00:14:54.160 --> 00:14:56.790
The new model isn't attacking?

00:15:01.910 --> 00:15:03.800
Come out,

00:15:03.800 --> 00:15:05.300
Argevollen.

00:15:14.050 --> 00:15:16.200
I heard what you said.

00:15:17.320 --> 00:15:18.480
I'm sorry.

00:15:18.480 --> 00:15:21.040
I'm going to pilot Arge.

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:26.240
But I can't activate it without you, Jamie.

00:15:26.240 --> 00:15:26.860
So...

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:27.910
You idiot!

00:15:29.040 --> 00:15:30.820
You're an idiot!

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:34.820
You might die!

00:15:37.690 --> 00:15:39.080
Aren't you scared?

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:42.580
I am.

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:44.560
You're an idiot!

00:15:44.560 --> 00:15:46.090
Idiot! Idiot! Idiot! Idiot!

00:15:48.560 --> 00:15:49.860
What's more,

00:15:49.860 --> 00:15:54.090
I'm an even bigger idiot
for going along with you!

00:15:55.400 --> 00:15:56.850
Jamie...

00:15:56.850 --> 00:16:02.100
If you die, I'm the idiot who let you!

00:16:02.430 --> 00:16:04.400
But I'll carry that burden, too.

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:06.490
I can't fight.

00:16:06.490 --> 00:16:07.950
But

00:16:07.950 --> 00:16:10.110
I'll carry the burden of your stupidity!

00:16:10.920 --> 00:16:12.110
Thank you.

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:26.920
Get going, idiot!

00:16:29.520 --> 00:16:31.030
And

00:16:31.030 --> 00:16:32.440
come back safe...

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:36.560
Argevollen has been sighted.

00:16:36.560 --> 00:16:37.680
I've been waiting.

00:16:47.610 --> 00:16:49.040
Namie, get back!

00:16:49.040 --> 00:16:49.980
Senpai?

00:16:50.550 --> 00:16:53.740
You stay in the rear and divert
the remaining Gunbasses!

00:16:54.110 --> 00:16:56.400
Are you okay, Senpai?

00:16:56.400 --> 00:16:57.330
I don't know.

00:16:58.520 --> 00:16:59.490
But...

00:16:59.760 --> 00:17:01.260
I will be coming back!

00:17:01.260 --> 00:17:02.570
Senpai!

00:17:03.630 --> 00:17:04.880
Again...

00:17:06.350 --> 00:17:08.880
Can I do nothing but just watch it happen again?

00:17:34.360 --> 00:17:35.490
Tokimune...

00:18:01.720 --> 00:18:02.670
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:18:02.670 --> 00:18:03.900
You did a good job.

00:18:04.940 --> 00:18:06.050
Lorenz-san...

00:18:06.050 --> 00:18:07.140
Silfy-san...

00:18:47.220 --> 00:18:48.690
Senpai!

00:19:15.370 --> 00:19:17.410
Who are you?

00:19:17.410 --> 00:19:20.220
You're not the one who gets to fight him!

00:19:20.220 --> 00:19:21.470
It's me!

00:19:21.950 --> 00:19:26.310
Don't die until after you've defeated
Argevollen, Second Lieutenant.

00:19:38.110 --> 00:19:39.320
Tokimune!

00:20:01.720 --> 00:20:03.300
It's going away...

00:20:41.760 --> 00:20:44.260
Argevollen has defeated the enemy's new model.

00:20:44.720 --> 00:20:46.080
This is Seeker.

00:20:46.080 --> 00:20:48.340
Enemy reinforcements are headed this way.

00:20:48.340 --> 00:20:48.890
Roger.

00:20:49.180 --> 00:20:51.160
We'll rendezvous soon.

00:20:51.160 --> 00:20:55.100
Tell Silfy's squad to continue
to watch the perimeter.

00:20:55.100 --> 00:20:56.520
Roger.

00:21:19.860 --> 00:21:21.170
We did it.

00:21:22.230 --> 00:21:22.920
No.

00:21:26.520 --> 00:21:27.950
I've lost.

00:21:40.000 --> 00:21:41.580
Yet again, you...

00:21:54.530 --> 00:21:56.380
Tokimune!

00:21:56.380 --> 00:21:59.290
You idiot!

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:13.310
We gaze into each other's eyes, open our hearts.

00:22:13.310 --> 00:22:19.520
A cycle of strength and weakness.

00:22:19.520 --> 00:22:26.150
Your eyes must have adjusted somewhat.

00:22:26.150 --> 00:22:32.830
Verbalize though I may,

00:22:32.830 --> 00:22:40.630
I remember that I can't

00:22:40.630 --> 00:22:47.260
rationalize everything

00:22:47.260 --> 00:22:54.430
The world will change, as long as I remain courageous.

00:22:55.680 --> 00:23:02.440
The telepathy I wouldn't have discovered alone,

00:23:02.440 --> 00:23:08.570
leads me ahead, behind your dazzling silouette.

00:23:08.570 --> 00:23:15.950
But even so, I'll keep my unwavering gaze on you;

00:23:15.950 --> 00:23:22.540
It'll reach you someday.

00:23:36.010 --> 00:23:38.980
Farewell
